1
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:05,680
HaxTalks Subs
Translations by MysteriousAura

2
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:10,140
Qiu Shan Jun and Xu You Rong will become husband and wife

3
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:12,060
Are there any objections?

4
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:14,680
I object!

5
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:20,640
Mister!

6
00:00:28,850 --> 00:00:29,560
I object!

7
00:00:39,270 --> 00:00:40,220
Take him down!

8
00:01:05,970 --> 00:01:07,640
Everyone, come on!

9
00:01:15,390 --> 00:01:16,720
Wait a second

10
00:01:17,390 --> 00:01:19,640
If you have something to say, step up here and do it

11
00:01:31,020 --> 00:01:36,220
Living all these seasons in the mountains, the wind and frost have dyed my clothes

12
00:01:38,520 --> 00:01:44,470
From far away, the youth play

13
00:01:47,220 --> 00:01:52,430
This red dust substance isn't like snow, it is like the moon

14
00:01:55,020 --> 00:02:01,390
My clothes feel thin and cool, they mock and make me crazy

15
00:02:01,970 --> 00:02:06,640
Asking what the meaning of my life is, or what I need to do

16
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:10,310
But the answer cannot be found in the books

17
00:02:10,310 --> 00:02:14,100
Living a long life is hard

18
00:02:14,100 --> 00:02:17,350
I hope I won't get lost along the way

19
00:02:18,100 --> 00:02:22,770
Asking what the meaning of my life is, or what I need to do

20
00:02:22,770 --> 00:02:26,430
But the answer cannot be found in the books

21
00:02:26,430 --> 00:02:30,220
Living a long life is hard

22
00:02:30,220 --> 00:02:36,680
I hope I won't get lost along the way

23
00:02:40,770 --> 00:02:45,770
Way of Choices

24
00:02:45,770 --> 00:02:48,890
Asking For Enlightenment

25
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,850
Emperor, I have heard that

26
00:03:21,310 --> 00:03:24,100
Qiu Shan Jun and Xu You Rong will become husband and wife

27
00:03:25,140 --> 00:03:26,350
You asked if anyone had an objection

28
00:03:26,350 --> 00:03:28,390
So I said that I object

29
00:03:29,350 --> 00:03:30,560
Who are you?

30
00:03:31,350 --> 00:03:36,350
Who do you think you are? Why are you objecting?

31
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:38,430
I am engaged to Xu You Rong

32
00:03:38,810 --> 00:03:40,310
She will become my wife in the future

33
00:03:41,310 --> 00:03:43,020
Naturally, she can’t marry anyone else

34
00:03:44,470 --> 00:03:45,100
Ridiculous!

35
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:49,020
Do you have no shame? 
I had to come a long way to attend this, are you mocking me?

36
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:53,390
I've never heard that Xu You Rong was already engaged. 
Where is your proof?

37
00:03:56,060 --> 00:03:57,350
I have the marriage vow as evidence

38
00:04:06,140 --> 00:04:07,060
This brat!

39
00:04:08,270 --> 00:04:12,560
Even if you took out the Heavenly books to serve as proof, 
no one here will believe you!

40
00:04:12,720 --> 00:04:13,270
I believe him!

41
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:15,520
My master has the right to marry anyone

42
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:20,060
Hmph. I believe him as well. This guy sure is a feisty one

43
00:04:20,520 --> 00:04:22,270
You should never be surprised by his decisions

44
00:04:22,810 --> 00:04:24,520
He doesn’t need to prove that he will be her future husband

45
00:04:24,520 --> 00:04:28,100
I'll still believe him if he says something even more ridiculous like being the son of the demon king.

46
00:04:28,970 --> 00:04:32,060
After I left my home in the south,
 I've gain the respect of tens of thousands of people

47
00:04:32,430 --> 00:04:36,310
The Emperor himself asked me to take care of his family affairs

48
00:04:36,310 --> 00:04:41,310
That year, the Emperor dubbed me as “The Master Who Has Ten Thousand Followers”

49
00:04:41,310 --> 00:04:44,970
And so, even the Divine Empress respects me a great deal

50
00:04:45,520 --> 00:04:49,970
I can’t believe that some little punk will dare insult me like this!

51
00:04:50,350 --> 00:04:53,470
The rest of you shouldn’t even give these insignificant beings the time of day

52
00:04:53,470 --> 00:04:55,930
Allow me to teach you two a lesson!

53
00:04:59,350 --> 00:05:02,840
Hey old man. Just because you're old 
doesn't mean you can bully us like this

54
00:05:03,710 --> 00:05:04,510
Presumptuous!

55
00:05:07,880 --> 00:05:11,380
Be careful. 
This person has already stepped foot into another dimension and is too strong

56
00:05:12,510 --> 00:05:17,210
Only the Empress or village chief Mao can match up to him

57
00:05:38,880 --> 00:05:39,340
Stop this right now!

58
00:05:39,630 --> 00:05:40,090
Hold on!

59
00:06:19,460 --> 00:06:20,050
Watch out!

60
00:07:03,460 --> 00:07:04,800
Mister Jin!

61
00:07:05,960 --> 00:07:06,710
You are...

62
00:07:07,630 --> 00:07:08,550
Jin Yu Lu!

63
00:07:09,340 --> 00:07:10,880
Mhm. That’s correct

64
00:07:11,210 --> 00:07:12,670
What in the world are you doing here?

65
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:21,170
Looks like General Jin has blessed us with his appearance

66
00:07:21,510 --> 00:07:22,550
Please forgive us

67
00:07:23,050 --> 00:07:25,340
Someone, please find a seat for General Jin

68
00:07:28,960 --> 00:07:30,170
Emperor, you are too kind

69
00:07:30,710 --> 00:07:31,920
There’s no need

70
00:07:32,170 --> 00:07:36,090
Jin Yu Lu? Isn’t he one of the four legendary generals of the demon realm?

71
00:07:37,300 --> 00:07:38,550
Umm, yes, Mister

72
00:07:38,880 --> 00:07:43,510
Jin Yu Lu!? I only heard rumours about him actually existing!

73
00:07:43,760 --> 00:07:45,960
What is a person of his caliber doing here??

74
00:07:47,380 --> 00:07:49,840
Mister Jin has always been protecting me

75
00:07:50,010 --> 00:07:51,340
Wait...what??? Then you..?

76
00:07:51,670 --> 00:07:54,920
Master, I wasn’t trying to hide my identity on purpose

77
00:07:55,050 --> 00:08:00,050
That’s not your fault, it’s just that there are many people who are curious about your identity

78
00:08:00,050 --> 00:08:01,300
Do you want to tell us?

79
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:03,840
I will listen to my master, of course!

80
00:08:10,340 --> 00:08:12,510
My last name is Bai. Bai as in Bai Di Castle

81
00:08:13,050 --> 00:08:15,800
My mother is the Empress of the west

82
00:08:16,550 --> 00:08:17,090
My father

83
00:08:17,460 --> 00:08:18,210
Is Bai Xing Ye

84
00:08:23,670 --> 00:08:24,300
And my master?

85
00:08:24,760 --> 00:08:25,590
Chen Chang Sheng

86
00:08:26,260 --> 00:08:29,630
I’ll ask again, old man. Are you still going to try and get rid of me?

87
00:08:30,960 --> 00:08:32,170
Hmph! I don’t have time for that!

88
00:08:34,210 --> 00:08:37,880
Everyone else, do we still need to object to my master and his wife to be’s marriage vow?

89
00:08:43,510 --> 00:08:55,010
The famous Bai Di Castle: it is home for eight hundred miles of red soil

90
00:09:07,630 --> 00:09:09,630
I am Gou Han Shi

91
00:09:10,090 --> 00:09:12,130
I am Chen Chang Sheng

92
00:09:12,510 --> 00:09:15,300
We all know that the mothers and fathers on both sides are set on the marriage

93
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:18,510
Now look at the marriage vow in your hands

94
00:09:18,760 --> 00:09:20,590
The last half belongs to you, but the first half belongs to us

95
00:09:21,260 --> 00:09:21,800
However

96
00:09:21,800 --> 00:09:22,340
But what?

97
00:09:24,170 --> 00:09:26,090
In retrospect, all of this isn’t important

98
00:09:26,550 --> 00:09:29,960
That’s because the person who sets the marriage aren’t the parents, nor the person who wrote the marriage vow

99
00:09:30,380 --> 00:09:31,760
It’s the people getting married that will make the final decision

100
00:09:32,300 --> 00:09:36,630
Anyway, my brothers and I have already consulted Miss You Rong about this

101
00:09:36,880 --> 00:09:38,880
So even if that marriage vow in your hands is authentic,

102
00:09:39,340 --> 00:09:41,880
Will she really be willing to marry you?

103
00:09:43,010 --> 00:09:46,960
If you really care about Miss You Rong, shouldn’t you respect her thoughts?

104
00:09:47,670 --> 00:09:51,090
As a man, you need to know that

105
00:09:52,800 --> 00:09:55,550
Right...if Xu You Rong wants to marry Qiu Shan Jun

106
00:09:55,800 --> 00:09:59,300
Will a marriage vow prevent that so easily?

107
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:04,340
Also, Qiu Shan Jun is the Dragon, how can Chen Chang Sheng even compare to him?

108
00:10:04,710 --> 00:10:05,260
That’s right!

109
00:10:06,760 --> 00:10:09,260
How do you know that’s what Xu You Rong really desires?

110
00:10:09,960 --> 00:10:11,880
Speaking all this nonsense

111
00:10:12,630 --> 00:10:13,340
What’s the point?

112
00:10:13,760 --> 00:10:16,550
Yeah, who cares about all that fancy stuff you just said?

113
00:10:16,960 --> 00:10:18,630
In my eyes, passion is the key

114
00:10:19,090 --> 00:10:21,510
Yup. Stop trying to give everyone silly ideas

115
00:10:23,260 --> 00:10:24,840
But the wedding matter between Qiu Shan Jun and Xu You Rong

116
00:10:25,340 --> 00:10:28,420
Is for the good of humanity! With their marriage, we can repel the demons!

117
00:10:29,420 --> 00:10:32,210
Everyone wishes for their marriage to become a reality!

118
00:10:33,380 --> 00:10:36,340
In order to repel the demons, everyone has to make sacrifices

119
00:10:36,920 --> 00:10:38,090
Am I not correct?

120
00:10:39,300 --> 00:10:42,050
May I ask, is this really the real problem at hand?

121
00:10:43,010 --> 00:10:45,630
To repel the demon clan, to unite humanity

122
00:10:46,340 --> 00:10:51,340
We need to force a girl to marry someone she doesn’t even want to marry?

123
00:10:52,050 --> 00:10:53,170
What kind of logic is that?

124
00:10:54,170 --> 00:10:58,050
If I must say everything now, my marriage with Xu You Rong is the actual matter we need to care about

125
00:10:58,460 --> 00:11:00,510
None of you have the right to object

126
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:09,380
Miss You Rong is not here right now, so no one knows what she thinks about all of this

127
00:11:10,300 --> 00:11:13,010
That been said, please forget everything I said,
 I wasted both of our time

128
00:11:15,010 --> 00:11:18,800
But the happenings tonight, rest assured that everyone has heard your opinion

129
00:11:19,210 --> 00:11:22,920
My senior brother, however, is not here either,
 so I don’t know what he thinks either

130
00:11:23,300 --> 00:11:25,090
So I think this isn’t fair

131
00:11:25,300 --> 00:11:26,710
How will it be fair, then?

132
00:11:27,010 --> 00:11:30,420
As an apprentice of our master, 
I have the right to represent him

133
00:11:31,340 --> 00:11:34,090
As the younger brother of my senior brother,
 I must not embarrass him either

134
00:11:34,800 --> 00:11:38,010
So whatever the case, 
I always have to do something

135
00:11:40,590 --> 00:11:41,260
Now…

136
00:11:42,710 --> 00:11:43,920
Please enlighten myself and the others

137
00:11:44,420 --> 00:11:48,260
Is he serious? Will Orthodox Academy really have the nerve to fulfill that request?

138
00:11:53,130 --> 00:11:56,800
On my way here, I got the news that Orthodox Academy has re-opened

139
00:11:57,380 --> 00:12:01,010
That immediately made me very curious 
as to what kind of person would do such a thing

140
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:05,590
Tonight, I now know that Miss Luo Luo also attends Orthodox Academy

141
00:12:05,880 --> 00:12:09,130
And her teacher is an extraordinary person indeed

142
00:12:09,800 --> 00:12:14,510
Tonight is the third night of Qing Tong Yan, 
it’s also the last chance to enroll in a school

143
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:18,210
We came from so far away, 
so we can’t pass up this opportunity

144
00:12:18,550 --> 00:12:22,800
In that case, I ask Orthodox Academy to enlighten us

145
00:12:25,590 --> 00:12:26,760
To fight or not to fight?

146
00:12:26,760 --> 00:12:27,670
If you want, we will fight!

147
00:12:30,420 --> 00:12:31,760
How about we discuss this?

148
00:12:34,210 --> 00:12:42,340
If you don’t, Qiu Shan Jun will be hard pressed 
and won't be able to let it go, I suggest you fight it out

149
00:12:42,340 --> 00:12:45,550
It’s very late though, so make it quick

150
00:12:46,800 --> 00:12:48,960
Looks like Qiu Shan Jun won’t be able to get a wife

151
00:12:49,420 --> 00:12:52,380
Stop trying to find an excuse to kill Chen Chang Sheng

152
00:12:53,210 --> 00:12:55,260
We’re only going to negotiate. Don’t overthink it

153
00:12:55,550 --> 00:12:58,510
Hmph. What’s with all this leaving the mountain stuff? Seems like a lie to me

154
00:12:58,880 --> 00:13:00,010
Do you have no shame?

155
00:13:00,420 --> 00:13:02,800
You’re clearly just trying to find an excuse to kill us

156
00:13:07,260 --> 00:13:08,670
Ridiculous!

157
00:13:10,090 --> 00:13:14,380
Tang Tang. Back off now. 
Don’t forget that you’re a student of Heavenly Academy

158
00:13:14,800 --> 00:13:16,170
Who’s side are you on? Hmph.

159
00:13:16,800 --> 00:13:18,760
Don’t try to use the name of Heavenly Academy to stop me

160
00:13:19,050 --> 00:13:23,170
I once said that I wanted to beat Tian Hai Ya Er. Saying that much was enough for you to prevent me from attending Qing Tong Yan

161
00:13:23,510 --> 00:13:27,510
Who cares if even the Tian Hai family is afraid of Heavenly Academy?

162
00:13:28,130 --> 00:13:31,300
This isn’t the Heavenly Academy that I imagined it to be. 
The so called best school.

163
00:13:32,170 --> 00:13:34,130
Don’t ever try to use the name of that academy to stop me!

164
00:13:34,130 --> 00:13:35,460
Shut it, right now!

165
00:13:35,920 --> 00:13:40,420
The entrance exams are already over. If you leave the academy, 
how are you going to enter the Grand Examination next year?

166
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:45,420
Your father has placed his trust in me. I definitely will not permit the trouble that you are trying to cause!

167
00:13:45,960 --> 00:13:47,550
That’s my own business. It’s none of yours

168
00:13:49,260 --> 00:13:53,710
You can come to my school. Students of Orthodox Academy have the right to enter the Grand Examination too

169
00:13:53,710 --> 00:13:54,840
Okay. Let’s do that!

170
00:13:55,460 --> 00:13:59,210
Luo Luo, tell caretaker to write his name on the registration documents later. 
Don’t forget to get him to stamp it as well

171
00:13:59,260 --> 00:14:03,170
Gladly. That means we have four students now!

172
00:14:03,800 --> 00:14:05,170
What an outrage!

173
00:14:05,920 --> 00:14:08,090
Congratulations. Orthodox Academy has another student now

174
00:14:08,090 --> 00:14:08,880
Thank you very much

175
00:14:09,710 --> 00:14:13,760
If my memory is correct, tonight is the third night of Qing Tong Yan. 
That means it’s the night for the writing portion

176
00:14:14,460 --> 00:14:15,420
Is that right?

177
00:14:15,420 --> 00:14:16,010
Don’t be ridiculous

178
00:14:16,630 --> 00:14:18,590
I beg your pardon?

179
00:14:18,670 --> 00:14:21,510
This entire country knows that you are a master in Daoism

180
00:14:21,760 --> 00:14:23,630
There's no way we can find someone as skilled as you are in that respect

181
00:14:24,010 --> 00:14:26,460
You want to have a writing test? What’s the point?

182
00:14:27,090 --> 00:14:30,210
I am just an ordinary person, I’m not a genius

183
00:14:30,590 --> 00:14:33,010
The only thing I’m good at is straight reading

184
00:14:33,380 --> 00:14:36,210
Reading is my xiu xing. Knowledge is my power

185
00:14:36,210 --> 00:14:39,260
I’m using my own power to win. What part of that is ridiculous?

186
00:14:39,800 --> 00:14:43,340
How are we even going to have a writing test?
 Don’t tell me you want to produce the test papers right this instant?

187
00:14:43,710 --> 00:14:45,510
Won’t fighting be much easier and efficient?

188
00:14:45,840 --> 00:14:46,550
How about it?

189
00:14:47,300 --> 00:14:48,090
No objections here

190
00:14:50,050 --> 00:14:52,260
If you persist, I will agree to your proposal

191
00:14:52,710 --> 00:14:55,800
You can decide the setting, and to person who will be fighting

192
00:14:56,130 --> 00:14:57,420
Then, let’s head outside the palace to fight

193
00:14:57,880 --> 00:14:58,920
After you

194
00:15:14,420 --> 00:15:18,420
Letting us pick where we fight 
and who will be fighting doesn’t really make a difference

195
00:15:19,380 --> 00:15:23,920
They’re all the top seven students. 
Winning against any one of them will be difficult

196
00:15:23,920 --> 00:15:26,170
...so that’s why Gou Han Shi was so confident

197
00:15:26,170 --> 00:15:29,300
He’s just like Qiu Shan Jun in the sense that he’s at a much higher level than us

198
00:15:29,300 --> 00:15:31,130
Almost like a divine being

199
00:15:31,590 --> 00:15:34,760
He brought up the written test so he won’t embarrass us if we fight him

200
00:15:35,130 --> 00:15:36,800
He was being considerate

201
00:15:36,880 --> 00:15:40,630
I brought up the fighting because I was hoping we would have a better chance at winning the best out of three with Luo Luo and myself fighting

202
00:15:40,630 --> 00:15:41,960
You don't have to fight

203
00:15:41,960 --> 00:15:45,880
As long as you don’t fight, they don’t have a way to recover their shame

204
00:15:46,340 --> 00:15:49,170
Then you can continue forcing your marriage with Xu You Rong onto them

205
00:15:49,170 --> 00:15:51,670
You’re saying like we can really win against them

206
00:15:51,670 --> 00:15:55,800
Doesn’t matter, we need to fight anyway. 
Princess Luo Luo, I will be fighting the seventh ranked student

207
00:15:56,840 --> 00:15:59,010
Okay, Guan Fei Bai will be my opponent then

208
00:15:59,380 --> 00:16:02,380
I am representing Orthodox Academy and will be fighting the first match. 
I want to challenge the seventh ranked student!

209
00:16:03,130 --> 00:16:03,920
Sure

210
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:09,380
Please, after you

211
00:16:13,460 --> 00:16:14,300
Come and get it!

212
00:16:38,260 --> 00:16:39,130
Three Forms of Wen Shui?!

